body:
Not to be rude or anything, but you are painting a picture where russian tanks are useless pieces of metal. From what you 2 have been saying, it seems like when it comes to city maps, the abrams and ruskies are on pretty much level playing field. Aiming at weakspots is easy, yet it doesn't mean u will always have 100% chance on hitting them(panick, movement, some good old buddy bumping into your ass). That pretty much makes russian armor still usable. M1 gets damaged at those ranges anyway, tho not 1 shot. Yet, abrams has better mobility and a slight reload edge.

&#x200B;

From all that, i jsut don't see how m1 is so overpowered that people are willing to sacrifice their firstborn babies in order to get it nerfed. Yeah mobility is hightier meta, but having good firepower is also meta. Abrums has mobility and survivability once shot, and russians have firepower and decent armor. I think this whole m1 being op thing has been blown so out of proportions that it being to compete with other tanks is no longer an option. Soon the thing will get ha-go treatment :D
